{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13218270","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13218270","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1321827001:1":{"text":"불쌍하기도 하지... 며칠 전에 사고를 당한 사람이 이 아이의 아버지인가요?","source_cn":"可怜的孩子，前几天遇难的男人是她的父亲吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A29254FFE9875A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321827002:1":{"text":"듀라 님께서 이 아이를 지켜주시기를... 그리고 아이의 부모님도 여신의 나라에서 영원한 안식을 누리기를.","source_cn":"愿艾雅保佑她，也愿她的父母在艾雅的国度得享安宁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CE5442AF95C7C92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321827003:1":{"text":"감사합니다, 오그리 수도사님. 올가의 부모님을 한 곳에 묻어주십시오.","source_cn":"感谢您，奥格列修士，就请您把她父母的骸骨葬在一起吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE2BDC482C39A790","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321827004:1":{"text":"네, 성당 묘지에 두 분을 묻어드리겠습니다. 가능하다면 장례식은 내일 아침에 치르는 것으로 하지요. 제가 직접 진행하겠습니다.","source_cn":"我知道了。我会将他们安葬在教堂的墓地内。如果可以的话，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE18A34BEC924B27E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321827005:1":{"text":"고맙습니다...","source_cn":"谢谢你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x607C8D9152AAD51A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321827006:1":{"text":"정말 감사합니다, 오그리 수도사님. 그러면 부탁드리겠습니다.","source_cn":"非常感谢，奥格列修士，这件事就劳烦你们了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAB091157742937D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321827007:1":{"text":"내일 아침에 시간 맞춰서 오겠습니다.","source_cn":"我们明天早晨会准时来参加葬礼的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33AEF51A8D538899","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:修士奥格列":{"text":"수도사 오그리","source":"修士奥格列","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:法拉莫尔":{"text":"팔라모르","source":"法拉莫尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奥尔嘉":{"text":"올가","source":"奥尔嘉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":3}}